# Docker

## Files
- `Dockerfile` — multi-stage: deps → build → runner
- `docker-compose.yml` — dev and prod profiles
- `.dockerignore` — exclude `node_modules`, `.git`, `.env.local`

## Practices
- Run as non-root user in production stage
- `NODE_ENV=production` in runner
- Use `standalone` Next.js output for smaller images
- Never copy `.env.local` into image; inject at runtime

## Commands
```bash
make docker-build   # Build production image
make docker-up      # Start containers
make docker-down    # Stop containers
```

## Dev
- Dev compose mounts source with hot reload
- Prod compose uses built standalone output
